Existing blocks2w selects generic packed math on the observed IQ/Q8 banks; the two-warp projection branch requires G/U types12/13. The credible candidate is therefore packed/shared fusion, which removes external shared-Dense production but changes routed down and shared reduction trees. Old20 metric cases are finite/self-row evidence, not quality acceptance. No current full-model performance exists. Root authorized a separate146f private selector/epoch/funding prototype using the existing kernels, with targetFP16/MTPFP32 outputs and routed512/public513 preserved. See assessment.json.
